  "notes": [
    "**Repetir** is a stem-changing verb: e→i",
    "Present: stem change e→i (except nosotros)",
    "Preterite: stem change e→i in 3rd person forms (repitió, repitieron)",
    "Imperfect: regular -IR pattern, NO stem change",
    "Same conjugation pattern as **pedir**, **servir**, **conseguir**, and **derretir**",
    "Common usage: *repetir la pregunta* (to repeat the question), *repetir un curso* (to repeat a course)",
    "Can also mean \"to have seconds\" (food): *¿Quieres repetir?* (Do you want seconds?)"
  ],
